# Portent reorders exactly the top three cards, declines the shuffle, and draws in the next turn's upkeep.
[Bot1 Deck]
Portent
Mox Sapphire
Island x5
Plains
Swamp
Mountain
Forest
Island x10
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Portent.Cast(Bot1)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Looked = Plains; Swamp; Mountain
Bot1.Arrange(Mountain; Plains; Swamp)
? Bot1.Library = Mountain; Plains; Swamp; Forest; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot1.Decline
[T2 Bot2.Upkeep]
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Mountain
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Mountain
Bot1.Shuffles = 0
